course: dictionary
lesson: 12639
title: Dispense
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: To dispense means to give something out, often in measured amounts. «The machine dispenses cold drinks when you press the button.» The machine gives out drinks one at a time, so dispense means give out.
explain: A chemist also dispenses medicine. «The chemist dispensed my medicine and read the label carefully.» The chemist prepares the right amount and hands it over. The clues are chemist, medicine and label, so the word is about giving out something carefully.
explain: Dispense can also mean do without. «Let's dispense with the speeches» means let's skip them. To check, swap your meaning into the sentence: "Let's skip with the speeches" does not work, but "Let's do without the speeches" does, so you have it right.
fact: Dispense is a verb, so its forms are dispense, dispenses, dispensed and dispensing.
fact: «Dispense» means to give out something, often in measured amounts.
fact: «Dispense medicine» means a chemist prepares it and gives it out.
fact: «Dispense with» means do without or get rid of, as in «dispense with the speeches».
fact: A «soap dispenser» is a machine that gives out soap, and a «cash dispenser» gives out money (in the UK, this is an ATM).
exercise: «The machine dispenses cold drinks.» What does dispenses mean here? | Hides away | Heats up | *Gives out | Breaks down
exercise: «Let's dispense with the speeches.» What does dispense with mean? | *Do without | Give a long speech | Practise for | Write down
exercise: «The chemist dispensed my medicine carefully.» What did the chemist do? | *Prepared and gave out | Threw away | Ate it | Lost the label
test: «The soap dispenser by the sink was empty.» What is a soap dispenser? | A cupboard for towels | A bowl for washing dishes | A tap that runs hot water | *A machine that gives out soap
test: «The judge dispenses justice in the court.» What does dispenses mean here? | Argues about | Takes away | *Gives out | Hides
exam: Which phrase means do without? | dispense medicine | cash dispenser | *dispense with | soap dispenser
